This project implements automatic PDF extraction, offline terminology translation,
and a desktop review workflow. It redistributes a sanitized derivative of the
upstream PDF template and its unmodified Roboto Regular/Medium fonts. Hidden
example identity text, portrait and QR resources have been removed; visual layout
is preserved. Since 1.2.0, main-table labels and values are redrawn and reflowed
according to selected source fields; source-note text comes from the Chinese document.
See chsi_translator/data/TEMPLATE_PROVENANCE.md for pinned revisions and changes.
